# Documentation order

When changing UI or data flows, consult in order:

1. `docs/doyess-film-design-system.md`
2. `docs/home-mockup-reference.md`
3. `docs/dashboard-mockup-reference.md`
4. `docs/imdb-csv-base.md`
5. `docs/imdb-export-tutorial.md`
6. `docs/google-oauth-setup.md` (si falla el login con Google)

Public landing uses static images in `public/`; TMDB enrichment is for authenticated dashboard flows (later phases).
